<h1>Remove Current 2D Section</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-US">This command is accessible from</span> <b><i style="font-style:normal; font-weight:bold;"><span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>2D Sections &gt; Remove Current</b></span></i></b> <span lang="EN-US">or by pressing</span> <b><i style="font-style:normal; font-weight:bold;"><span class="Button" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Remove</b></span> <span lang="EN-US">button</span></i> in the</b> <span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Adjust section plane</b></span> <span lang="EN-US">dialog.</span></p>
<p class="Description"><span class="Command" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> <span class="Command">Remove Current 2D Section</span> <span lang="EN-US">command deletes the existing 2D section plane from the current report page. If there is no 2D section plane defined, the command will be grayed.</span></p>
<p class="Note" id="P1"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Note</b></span><span lang="EN-US">: If this command is used for a view aligned to plane, the compared object will be displayed in 3D keeping the same perspective.</span></p>
